REM Cycles the onboard RGB LED through test colors (off, white, blue, red, purple, magenta, green).
DEFAULTDELAY 1000
REM LED off
LED 0 0 0
REM LED white
LED 255 255 255
REM LED blue
LED 0 0 255
REM LED red
LED 255 0 0
REM LED purple
LED 128 0 255
REM LED magenta
LED 255 0 255
REM LED green
LED 0 255 0
